Read docs/product/state.yaml if present. Without state, starter maintenance is allowed. With state, product UI/routes/features require shape done or explicit ui_writes; do not bypass hooks.

Read AGENTS.md once and load .agents/skills/<phase>/SKILL.md only when needed. /next drives work; status/check-drift report progress. Skill aliases share the same source.

Branch from/target staging; hooks deny main pushes/PRs. Production release is an explicit owner action.
